{"ID":"20240522082225-j5mt6zc","Spec":"2","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"custom-sy-readonly":"true","id":"20240522082225-j5mt6zc","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240522082225-j5mt6zc\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240522105651-48ncbqn\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240522105704-nfl549w\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:2200,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240522105704-o074nx8\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:37,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:37\u0026#125;","title":"劉醫師的胃癌案例","type":"doc","updated":"20240522105704"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240522105651-48ncbqn","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522105651-48ncbqn","updated":"20240522105658"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"刘菲菲医师的胃癌案例-----------谁更不信西医？"}]},{"ID":"20240522105704-l891f29","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522105704-l891f29","updated":"20240522105759"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"初诊： 2010年9月3日。"}]},{"ID":"20240522105704-5jtwb4d","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522105704-5jtwb4d","updated":"20240522105704"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"女，白人，49岁。此人以前是西医院急诊室的护士。"}]},{"ID":"20240522105704-d1urz8e","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522105704-d1urz8e","updated":"20240522105704"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"主诉：胃癌，吐血，直肠出血，每天吐，拉血7-8次。色鲜红。双肾区痛，肝区痛，现靠吗啡止痛。每日用吗啡7-8片。被告知只能活3个月。来诊前因两次大量吐血和便血，家人急送急诊室，3天前向我咨询过。2天前，再次大出血，家人再次送急诊室。病人自己拔掉静脉输液，从医院里偷偷溜出来。跑来我诊所。"}]},{"ID":"20240522105704-kcasmgo","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522105704-kcasmgo","updated":"20240522105704"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"病人过去病史如下：2009年9月西医确诊为胃癌。2009 年至今，胃做过4次活检。未做过任何放疗，化疗。过去曾做过肝活检，子宮切除術，阑尾切除，胆切除。2次乳房隆胸，脂肪吸除手術等。"}]},{"ID":"20240522105704-666qqrj","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522105704-666qqrj","updated":"20240522105704"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"问诊:"}]},{"ID":"20240522105704-ff6dljj","Type":"NodeList","ListData":{"Typ":1},"Properties":{"id":"20240522105704-ff6dljj","updated":"20240522105704"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240522105704-rvk8jj2","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Delimiter":46,"Marker":"MS4=","Num":1},"Properties":{"id":"20240522105704-rvk8jj2","updated":"20240522105704"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240522105704-qqci43u","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522105704-qqci43u","updated":"20240522105704"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"睡：不好，难以入睡，4AM 后才入睡。"}]}]},{"ID":"20240522105704-tqw2b4q","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Delimiter":46,"Marker":"Mi4=","Num":2},"Properties":{"id":"20240522105704-tqw2b4q","updated":"20240522105704"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240522105704-uzkupdg","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522105704-uzkupdg","updated":"20240522105704"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"双足冷。手尚可。"}]}]},{"ID":"20240522105704-rl8gu49","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Delimiter":46,"Marker":"My4=","Num":3},"Properties":{"id":"20240522105704-rl8gu49","updated":"20240522105704"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240522105704-xpo4d5b","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522105704-xpo4d5b","updated":"20240522105704"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"胃口不好"}]}]},{"ID":"20240522105704-08rp918","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Delimiter":46,"Marker":"NC4=","Num":4},"Properties":{"id":"20240522105704-08rp918","updated":"20240522105704"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240522105704-fwftl14","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522105704-fwftl14","updated":"20240522105704"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"口渴：白天不渴，11PM – 6 AM 渴，喜温饮。"}]}]},{"ID":"20240522105704-nzr67nq","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Delimiter":46,"Marker":"NS4=","Num":5},"Properties":{"id":"20240522105704-nzr67nq","updated":"20240522105704"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240522105704-cpmt15t","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522105704-cpmt15t","updated":"20240522105704"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"大便：每天7-8次，未见清谷。大便绿色，出血时红色。几个月前是黑色。"}]}]},{"ID":"20240522105704-r66e17b","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Delimiter":46,"Marker":"Ni4=","Num":6},"Properties":{"id":"20240522105704-r66e17b","updated":"20240522105704"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240522105704-g54ooai","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522105704-g54ooai","updated":"20240522105704"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"小便：一日3次，色中黄"}]}]},{"ID":"20240522105704-uzuu2b5","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Delimiter":46,"Marker":"Ny4=","Num":7},"Properties":{"id":"20240522105704-uzuu2b5","updated":"20240522105704"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240522105704-esvetyn","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522105704-esvetyn","updated":"20240522105704"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"白天整天出汗，晚上盗汗严重。"}]}]},{"ID":"20240522105704-6ihzh2m","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Delimiter":46,"Marker":"OC4=","Num":8},"Properties":{"id":"20240522105704-6ihzh2m","updated":"20240522105704"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240522105704-vmymgfl","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522105704-vmymgfl","updated":"20240522105704"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"体力很差。"}]}]},{"ID":"20240522105704-9r93tw8","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Delimiter":46,"Marker":"OS4=","Num":9},"Properties":{"id":"20240522105704-9r93tw8","updated":"20240522105704"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240522105704-wfr02yj","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522105704-wfr02yj","updated":"20240522105704"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"晚上身热，头，颈多热。"}]}]}]},{"ID":"20240522105704-rhxkpnb","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522105704-rhxkpnb","updated":"20240522105704"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"检查：胆结石，肾结石。肝积毒素。"}]},{"ID":"20240522105704-gnuyhox","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522105704-gnuyhox","updated":"20240522105704"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"处方如下："}]},{"ID":"20240522105704-ma0d9xv","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522105704-ma0d9xv","updated":"20240522105704"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"甘草三钱 ，XXX三钱，XX三钱（冲服），XXX五钱，XX三钱，XX三钱，XX三钱，XX五钱，XX三钱。"}]},{"ID":"20240522105704-7t10i93","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522105704-7t10i93","updated":"20240522105704"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2附，九碗水煮成3碗，早晚餐前各一碗。"}]},{"ID":"20240522105704-uqqh4j3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522105704-uqqh4j3","updated":"20240522105704"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"瞩立即停掉咖啡。并要求病人遵守饮食各项条款。（想起倪师所说，西医不叫病人停咖啡，病人怎么会好？）"}]},{"ID":"20240522105757-e618rdl","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522105757-e618rdl"}},{"ID":"20240522105704-pg3m8rg","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522105704-pg3m8rg","updated":"20240522105802"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"9/6/2010 二诊。"}]},{"ID":"20240522105704-ki6p4v3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522105704-ki6p4v3","updated":"20240522105704"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"出血和吐血减少。"}]},{"ID":"20240522105704-b987lzv","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522105704-b987lzv","updated":"20240522105704"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"上方加XXX五钱。 再三付。九碗水煮成3碗，三餐前服。一日三次。"}]},{"ID":"20240522105803-h44qpgk","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522105803-h44qpgk"}},{"ID":"20240522105704-w5ndfiv","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522105704-w5ndfiv","updated":"20240522105802"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"9/9/2010 三诊。"}]},{"ID":"20240522105704-uft494l","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522105704-uft494l","updated":"20240522105704"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"吐血和拉血已完全止住。已停用50%的吗啡。有剧烈的肾区痛和右肋痛。睡好转，胃口好转。体力很差。"}]},{"ID":"20240522105704-tobmthr","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522105704-tobmthr","updated":"20240522105704"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"查：双肾结石，胆结石（虽然胆已切除。）"}]},{"ID":"20240522105704-d5t4cpm","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522105704-d5t4cpm","updated":"20240522105704"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"处方如下：XX五钱，XX六钱，XX三钱，XX五钱，XX三钱，XX二钱，XX三钱，白芍五钱。。"}]},{"ID":"20240522105704-h82lkfy","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522105704-h82lkfy","updated":"20240522105704"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"6碗水煮2碗，早晚餐前各一碗。"}]},{"ID":"20240522105704-x8l7ma1","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522105704-x8l7ma1","updated":"20240522105704"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"科中：XXX 。中餐和睡前各6勺。"}]},{"ID":"20240522105807-yf3wxfj","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522105807-yf3wxfj"}},{"ID":"20240522105704-dktjrft","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522105704-dktjrft","updated":"20240522105806"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"9/18/2010 四诊："}]},{"ID":"20240522105704-tq07wf4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522105704-tq07wf4","updated":"20240522105704"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"肾区和右肋痛好转很多，仍偶尔。无呕血，无血便。睡好转，但仍难以入睡，头痛，胃口好转，盗汗严重。"}]},{"ID":"20240522105704-r8of61x","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522105704-r8of61x","updated":"20240522105704"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"处方如下："}]},{"ID":"20240522105704-9l1x0gz","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522105704-9l1x0gz","updated":"20240522105704"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"XXX。9碗煮3碗，早晚餐前一碗。"}]},{"ID":"20240522105704-n0sm0vk","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522105704-n0sm0vk","updated":"20240522105704"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"HT-14号，中餐和睡前各30粒。"}]},{"ID":"20240522105810-c140kgq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522105810-c140kgq"}},{"ID":"20240522105704-096pa97","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522105704-096pa97","updated":"20240522105809"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"10/2/2010 再诊："}]},{"ID":"20240522105704-zerxj8v","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522105704-zerxj8v","updated":"20240522105704"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"过去几天水样便，一日十几次。褐色粘状水样，病人自述奇臭无比，（病人说她在医院工作多年，也从来没有闻过这种味道。）已无盗汗。现有呕心，时冷时热，头痛。体力很差。"}]},{"ID":"20240522105704-dgiq0fg","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522105704-dgiq0fg","updated":"20240522105704"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"处方如下："}]},{"ID":"20240522105704-ayfivfm","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522105704-ayfivfm","updated":"20240522105704"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"XXX"}]},{"ID":"20240522105704-9l7t46o","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522105704-9l7t46o","updated":"20240522105704"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"九碗水煮三碗，早晚餐前各一碗。"}]},{"ID":"20240522105813-eb5iodu","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522105813-eb5iodu"}},{"ID":"20240522105704-ktssyto","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522105704-ktssyto","updated":"20240522105812"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"10/6/2010 诊："}]},{"ID":"20240522105704-xlgw75h","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522105704-xlgw75h","updated":"20240522105704"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"肾区痛好转但仍痛。腹泻已止住，尿道灼热感，忽冷忽热好很多，但仍有，晚上觉得热，但无盗汗了。脖子痛。昨日半夜肚子饿。（想起倪师曰：胃气回头了。）"}]},{"ID":"20240522105704-ni7u177","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522105704-ni7u177","updated":"20240522105704"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"上方改XX为八钱，炮附子改为三钱。加XX六钱。九碗水煮三碗，早晚餐前各一碗。"}]},{"ID":"20240522105704-rj9w34s","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522105704-rj9w34s","updated":"20240522105704"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"科中：XXX每次六勺，中餐和睡前各一次。"}]},{"ID":"20240522105815-fidnje0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522105815-fidnje0"}},{"ID":"20240522105704-elx5tfx","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522105704-elx5tfx","updated":"20240522105814"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"10/13/10 诊"}]},{"ID":"20240522105704-sq7ts6j","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522105704-sq7ts6j","updated":"20240522105704"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"病人自述昨日是过去的六年来第一次全身上下无痛，睡眠很好，体力很好，胃口很好，无盗汗，小便淡黄，但浊。口渴有，喜温饮。别人从不相信她有过胃癌，认为她和正常人一样。"}]},{"ID":"20240522105821-vhwsr5w","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522105821-vhwsr5w"}},{"ID":"20240522105704-gxquqif","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522105704-gxquqif","updated":"20240522105819"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"10/13/10 至今，处方以小柴胡汤为主方，随症加减XXX等药。煮四神汤当零食吃。"}]},{"ID":"20240522105821-wviz4oh","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522105821-wviz4oh"}},{"ID":"20240522105704-4dwz063","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522105704-4dwz063","updated":"20240522105820"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"12/22/10 病人电话来电，出现喉咙痛等感冒症状。汤药外，加XXX科中。"}]},{"ID":"20240522105822-3tdzw2i","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522105822-3tdzw2i"}},{"ID":"20240522105704-o074nx8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522105704-o074nx8","updated":"20240522105704"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"学生认为，此人病已从少阳退出太阳。她仍在继续治疗中，因为尚未到停药的时机。"}]},{"ID":"20240522105704-ik59sln","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522105704-ik59sln","updated":"20240522105704"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"病人告诉我，其实她早就在一个月前开始去外面找工作了。她说，她从吃第一天吃中药5天后血完全止住的那一天起，她就知道她不会死了。治疗的期间，有她的家人，邻居，朋友说她“CRAZY”不去作手术，而却跑来拿中药，还要煮，难闻，难吃。而她却告诉我，她遵守医瞩就象“Read Bible”.我问她，为何如此信我。她答说，在她最后一次大出血住院时，她一刹那间明白了，那么多年了，西医没有治好她，现在也不会治好她。如果她在医院那里呆着，她只有死路一条，于是，不顾一切，不顾家人的反对，自己拔掉静脉点滴输液，半夜里从医院里跑出来。第二天一大早就来诊了。"}]},{"ID":"20240522105704-fj7awjv","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522105704-fj7awjv","updated":"20240522105704"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"此人从来没有看过中医。只是在最后一次住院前2天在先生的介绍下。与我面谈了5分钟。求生的欲望是人和动物的本能。此人的勇气和COMMEN SENSE 是她自救的关键。“知己知彼，百战不殆。”她不知道中医能做多少。但她深知她自己所学的西医没有办法挽救她自己的生命。因为她比很多人都了解西医。她逢人就说中医的好。"}]},{"ID":"20240522105704-rs670m5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522105704-rs670m5","updated":"20240522105704"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"学生坚信：此人余生的健康路上，一定会选择中医。请允许我向读者发问：谁更不信西医？"}]},{"ID":"20240522105704-fcioveb","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522105704-fcioveb","updated":"20240522105747"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"学生菲菲报告完毕"}]},{"ID":"20240522105704-j04q25d","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522105704-j04q25d","updated":"20240522105704"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"　"}]},{"ID":"20240522105704-ln4r8qi","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522105704-ln4r8qi","updated":"20240522105744"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"老師評語"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240522105704-ca5ohba","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522105704-ca5ohba","updated":"20240522105704"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"    當老師最快樂的心情，就是看到學生都能學有所成，劉同學的案例非常好，當然也是十分精采，老師將其處方刪除，不公開是有原因的，因為現在已經發現有不屑人士在網路上公開說可以保證 治好各種癌症，然後要求病家支付十萬美金做為治療代價，這種漫天要價的舉動是被人神所唾棄的行為，當醫師這個職業，也是要賺錢的，如果都不賺錢，誰又願意去當醫師呢？但是這種賺錢的方式，簡直令人噁心。"}]},{"ID":"20240522105704-2wg1z1w","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522105704-2wg1z1w","updated":"20240522105707"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"    劉同學在海外發揚中醫學，替中國人爭光，這是炎黃子孫的榮耀，務必繼續加油，就更多人的生命，老師的心血沒有白費啊。"}]},{"ID":"20240522105704-uve4n10","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522105704-uve4n10","updated":"20240522105704"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"    如果這群人是看人紀盜版的，然後將人紀裡介紹的處方拿出來，公開販賣，同學們說，這該是屬於哪種人呢？所以老師將處方隱藏起來，有興趣想知道的同學們，可以寫信跟老師要求看處方，請注意，不是每位同學要求，老師就會給的，如果沒有消息，就是不給，老師這樣做是為了保護病人。"}]},{"ID":"20240522105704-nfl549w","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522105704-nfl549w","updated":"20240522105704"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"漢唐中醫 倪海廈謹記於佛州2010年12月30日"}]}]}